            0.7,
            0.3
          ],
          "hold": 0.9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "piping",
      "say": "Now you pile up a wall of dirt. Water sneaks underneath and carves a tunnel. This is called piping. Gary plugs it with a finger. Gary is now a cork.",
