          "style": "term"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "spill",
      "say": "Then it rains for a week, and the lake pours over the top. So you add a spillway, an emergency exit for water. Gary uses it as a water slide. Exactly once.",
      "callouts": [
        {
          "at": "spillway",
